OL,3,GNEWSABoy injured in police car and
OL,4,Ae-bike crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA boy suffered a serious leg injury in
OL,7,Fa crash between a Kent Police car and
OL,8,Fan e-bike, the force says.
OL,10,FThe secondary school-age boy remains in
OL,11,Fhospital in a stable condition after
OL,12,Fthe collision at about 03:20 GMT on
OL,13,FMonday in Lodge Oak Lane, Tonbridge,
OL,14,Fpolice said.
OL,16,FAnother man, who was also on the
OL,17,Fe-bike, received first aid after being
OL,18,Finjured in the crash.
OL,20,FKent Police says it has referred itself
OL,21,Fto the Independent Office for Police
OL,22,FConduct.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
